#
# Reviewing means: clone or fetch the repo, diff `ref` below against their
# current head, and look at engine-java/ only. Their packages/app and
# packages/engine are a separate application that shares none of our code, and
# the bulk of any delta will be there. What reaches us is
# engine-java/patches/, engine-java/src/, and patches/LEDGER.md as the
# explanation of them. Then move the ref here and say in review what was taken
# and what was skipped.
#
# The CARVE-IN commit is not recorded and cannot be recovered: the extensions
